The static call-chain supports the fix. In W&B 0.15.4, `WANDB_MODE=offline` maps to `_offline=True`; init skips login/user-server settings, the handler acknowledges the run locally, and the writer persists ordinary run/config/history/metric/media records without forwarding them to the sender. Therefore `sender._init_run()`—the only path here to `upsert_run()` and `server_settings_introspection()`—is not reached. Lightning 2.1.0’s `watch`, metric/config logging, media logging, and normal finish all operate through that local run/interface path.
